title: Customer_DoorQuestion_EN
---
Customer: Excuse me, is this door the entrance?

Player: Yes.

Customer: And the other door?

Player: That's the exit.

Customer: Oh... so the entrance is for entering.

Player: Exactly.

Customer: Excellent. Thank you.
===

title: Customer_FreezerQuestion_EN
---
Customer: Excuse me, are the frozen products cold?

Player: ...Yes.

Customer: Even when they're in the freezer?

Player: Especially when they're in the freezer.

Customer: Makes sense. Thanks.
===

title: Customer_SelfCheckoutQuestion_EN
---
Customer: Excuse me, is this self-checkout so I can do the work myself?

Player: Technically, yes.

Customer: And do I get paid for doing it?

Player: No.

Customer: Then this seems like a bad deal.
===

title: Customer_ReceiptQuestion_EN
---
Customer: Excuse me, does the receipt print after I pay?

Player: Yes.

Customer: Not before?

Player: No.

Customer: Good. I just wanted to make sure the paper wasn't getting ahead of itself.
===
